# Agents index

Cursor-only hook. The same check is required by `.cursor/AGENTS.md`.

After creating, renaming, or deleting a nested `AGENTS.md`, `SKILL.md`, or `/opsx-*` command, run `npm run agents:check`. Do not finish while it is red.
